 "key_big": "Prozent heißt „von Hundert“.",
 "key_sub": "Bruch auf den Nenner 100 erweitern – schon hast du Prozent.",
 "body_html": "<h2>So geht's</h2><p><b>Prozent</b> bedeutet „von Hundert“: 1 % = <span class='fr'><span class='fn'>1</span><span class='fd'>100</span></span> = 0,01.</p><p>Ein Bruch wird zu Prozent, indem man auf den Nenner 100 erweitert: <span class='fr'><span class='fn'>3</span><span class='fd'>4</span></span> = <span class='fr'><span class='fn'>75</span><span class='fd'>100</span></span> = 75 %.</p><p>Eine Dezimalzahl wird zu Prozent, indem man mit 100 multipliziert: 0,4 = 40 %.</p><p>Anteile mit verschiedenen Grundwerten vergleicht man am besten in Prozent.</p><div class='sn-tw'><table class='sn-table'><thead><tr><th>Bruch</th><th>Dezimalzahl</th><th>Prozent</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class='fr'><span class='fn'>1</span><span class='fd'>2</span></span></td><td>0,5</td><td>50 %</td></tr><tr><td><span class='fr'><span class='fn'>1</span><span class='fd'>4</span></span></td><td>0,25</td><td>25 %</td></tr><tr><td><span class='fr'><span class='fn'>3</span><span class='fd'>4</span></span></td><td>0,75</td><td>75 %</td></tr><tr><td><span class='fr'><span class='fn'>1</span><span class='fd'>5</span></span></td><td>0,2</td><td>20 %</td></tr><tr><td><span class='fr'><span class='fn'>1</span><span class='fd'>10</span></span></td><td>0,1</td><td>10 %</td></tr><tr><td><span class='fr'><span class='fn'>1</span><span class='fd'>100</span></span></td><td>0,01</td><td>1 %</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class='sn-ex'><span class='sn-ex-t'>Beispiel</span><p class='sn-ex-q'>12 von 20 in Prozent</p><p class='sn-ex-s'><span class='fr'><span class='fn'>12</span><span class='fd'>20</span></span> = <span class='fr'><span class='fn'>60</span><span class='fd'>100</span></span></p><p class='sn-ex-a'>Lösung: 60 %</p></div><div class='sn-ex'><span class='sn-ex-t'>Beispiel</span><p class='sn-ex-q'>25 % von 80 €</p><p class='sn-ex-s'>25 % = <span class='fr'><span class='fn'>1</span><span class='fd'>4</span></span></p><p class='sn-ex-s'>80 € : 4</p><p class='sn-ex-a'>Lösung: 20 €</p></div><h2>Typische Fehler</h2><div class='sn-tw'><table class='sn-table'><thead><tr><th>Typischer Fehler</th><th>So ist es richtig</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>0,5 = 5 %</td><td>0,5 = 0,50 = 50 %</td></tr><tr><td><span class='fr'><span class='fn'>1</span><span class='fd'>4</span></span> = 4 %</td><td><span class='fr'><span class='fn'>1</span><span class='fd'>4</span></span> = <span class='fr'><span class='fn'>25</span><span class='fd'>100</span></span> = 25 %</td></tr><tr><td>18 Treffer sind besser als 12 Treffer</td><td>Anteil vergleichen: 18 von 30 = 60 %, 12 von 16 = 75 %</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
